{"title":"Copperhead","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 19 Snake that attacks with corrode (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">slash</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">corrode</span><span class=\"tag-chip resist\">crush</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      <p class=\"s good\">⭐ Seen as an elite 1 times (3.8% of sightings). Elites have 3× HP, hit 1.4× harder, give 3× XP and 2.5× loot.</p>\n      <p class=\"s\">Special: venomChance: .25 | venomDamage: 8 | venomDurationMs: 4e3</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 1 looted corpse recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"snake-fang\" title=\"Snake Fang - in 100% of 1 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 5 total, 5 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/f1a8cba3a8479382b961.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Snake Fang</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">100% · 1/1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"snakeskin-knick\" title=\"Snakeskin Knick - in 100% of 1 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 5 total, 5 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/9728c594370aae49ebbb.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Snakeskin Knick</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">100% · 1/1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"bearhide-torso\" title=\"Bearhide Torso (leopard x1) - in 100% of 1 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/ede6dbbeeddfa6e7c5c3.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Bearhide Torso</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">100% · 1/1</span><span class=\"entity-chip-quality\">Excellent: 1 of 1 · Enchanted: 1 of 1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"snake-meat\" title=\"Snake Meat - in 100% of 1 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/d15830124444cf29d721.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Snake Meat</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">100% · 1/1</span></div></div></div><div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Percentages are of the corpses whose loot the collector recorded, so kills you did not loot are not counted.</div></div>\n      \n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Outrider%20Camp\">Outrider Camp</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 19 spots</span></li><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Windthorne\">Windthorne</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 2 spots</span></li><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Bandit%20Cave\">Bandit Cave</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 2 spots</span></li></ul><button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"copperhead-medium\">Show on map</button>\n      \n      <h2>Related</h2><p>Other Snake: <a href=\"#/monster/coral-snake-small\">Small Coral Snake</a> <span class=\"muted\">(6)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/coral-snake-medium\">Coral Snake</a> <span class=\"muted\">(8)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/coral-snake-large\">Large Coral Snake</a> <span class=\"muted\">(12)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/copperhead-small\">Small Copperhead</a> <span class=\"muted\">(14)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/copperhead-large\">Large Copperhead</a> <span class=\"muted\">(25)</span></p>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/combat\">Combat</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monster-families\">Monster families</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monsters-by-level\">Monsters by level</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"dat